ause she was so talented  her first professional acting roles were  sketches on The Tonight Show with Jay  Leno know that's Jimmy Fallon Jay Leno  ran the show for a long time starting in  the early 90s after that she got a few  guest roles on television shows  followed by tiny roles in movies but she  moved up the ladder of success really  fast she got her first major role on the  show  raising dad in 2001 she was just 12  years old then she got a role on the  Disney Channel Original Movie right on  track she continued to act while she was  working on her album she also got a  major role on the TV show the United  States of Tara then Scott Pilgrim vs.  the world was released when she was 20  and that launched her into success  basically you can't win this fight so  you're gonna have to give up on this  girl because Todd's gonna kill you her  roles became a lot bigger after that  brie is only 29 at the time of this  video but she has been acting for over  two decades  can you believe it girl power it's not  always easy to be a woman in Hollywood  and brie Larson is very outspoken about  what women deal with in the  entertainment industry brie Larson made  waves when she presented Casey Affleck  with his Oscar in 2016 the actor was the  center of some major controversies about  being really inappropriate with women  brie handed him his Oscar but she did  not smile or clap many women applauded  her for not condoning his behavior she  didn't make a huge deal about it though  she said her actions speak for  themselves she handled her activism for  women with total class in 2017 she took  her activism a step further brie had  been associated with the nonprofit  organization Cinna family this  entertainment company showed movies at  an old theater and raised funds for  various humanitarian work but then two  of the board members were accused of the  same type of things that Casey Affleck  and many other men were Bree stopped  supporting Cinna family the organization  has 